Kubernetes Day 1: Docker, Minikube, kubectl, and Pod Setup
1. Objective
The objective of this task is to set up a local Kubernetes environment on a Linux server using Docker and Minikube, install kubectl, create a Pod using Nginx, and deploy a Pod using a YAML manifest file.

